1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
THIS SERIES IS A WORK OF FICTION
CREATED FOR ENTERTAINMENT PURPOSES

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,360
ANY SIMILARITY OR RESEMBLANCE
TO ACTUAL PERSONS, LIVING OR DEAD

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,920
OR TO REAL ORGANIZATIONS, INSTITUTIONS,
OR RELIGIOUS GROUPS IS ENTIRELY COINCIDENTAL

4
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:12,280
PORNHOVA CHURCH COMMUNITY

5
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:26,000
Have you seen Rueang?

6
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,240
Thank you.

7
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,680
Excuse me, have you seen Rueang?

8
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,120
Oh, Ms. Tulya.

9
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:44,040
What are you doing here?

10
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:48,240
You're pregnant and all. Are you alone?

11
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,160
-Yes.
-Where's Mr. Chris?

12
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,840
He didn't come.

13
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:53,440
Have you seen Rueang?

14
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:56,280
Oh, has he been released already?

15
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,320
-I'll go look for him first.
-Okay.

16
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:04,240
A fire! Run!

17
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,480
There's a fire
at the Pornhova Church Community.

18
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,040
Please come quickly.

19
00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:58,200
Rueang? Are you here?

20
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,720
Help...

21
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,680
-Help!
-Ma'am?

22
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:15,280
Help me.

23
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:19,080
Our Father in Heaven,

24
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:23,640
as fire and darkness surround humanity,

25
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:29,000
may you be with those walking through danger.

26
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:30,760
Tul?

27
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,520
Tul!

28
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,200
Tul!

29
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:38,480
Chris?

30
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:41,200
Chris...

31
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,320
Please give strength

32
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:47,000
to those carrying the lives of others
on their shoulders.

33
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:53,560
Please grant wisdom

34
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,680
to those who must make decisions
amid the flames.

35
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:07,040
Please protect and watch over every life.

36
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:12,600
May we all get through
this ordeal with faith.

37
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:15,240
May Your hand guide us

38
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:19,320
and bring peace back
to the Pornhova Church Community,

39
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:21,160
Your beloved community.

40
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,480
Song, hurry up, get this to the villagers.

41
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,600
Yes, sir.

42
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:32,880
Please help my child and grandchildren.

43
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,680
Please help them.

44
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,400
They are Your children.

45
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:41,960
I place their lives in Your hands.

46
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:47,360
I ask this in the name of Jesus Christ. Amen.

47
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:27,000
Chris... Chris!

48
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:28,640
Chris?

49
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,880
A fire broke out
at the Pornhova Church Community...

50
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:25,120
My grandson is such a strong little boy.

51
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:27,200
-Chubbiest and strongest.
-after several loud explosions were heard.

52
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:32,160
Authorities initially suspect the cause
to be from a cooking gas leak,

53
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:35,680
leading to an explosion
and causing the fire to spread rapidly.

54
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:39,800
-That's enough. Just turn it off.
-All the houses were damaged...

55
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:42,040
-I don't want to hear this.
-At least two people have been reported dead

56
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:45,640
-with several others injured.
-It's noisy, right? Look at you.

57
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:48,280
-Rescue workers...
-Aren't you so adorable?

58
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:51,480
You're so chubby and healthy.

59
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:55,280
Grandma's going to name you, okay?
How about Luca?

60
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:59,640
It represents compassion,

61
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:02,760
humanity, and truth.

62
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:08,800
Chris and I have already
chosen a name for him.

63
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,400
Tuangboon, right?

64
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:17,520
Oh, I understand.
You wanted a name similar to your father's,

65
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:21,560
the late Judge Tuangtham, right?

66
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:25,160
Mom... Tul and I
have already talked about it.

67
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:33,040
Exactly. Just let them choose a name
for their baby, okay?

68
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:37,920
We're just the grandparents.
It's none of our business.

69
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:41,400
This child belongs to Pornhova.

70
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:44,240
His name should represent the Lord.

71
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:48,120
My son's name is Tuangboon.

72
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:51,120
Tuangboon Pornhova.

73
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:59,200
Tuangboon Pornhova?

74
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:00,560
That's nice.

75
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:04,120
But, Tul...

76
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:06,600
But the boy's grandfather is named Sansern,

77
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,760
and his father's Sattha.

78
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:14,760
So Luca must be named Sathukarn Pornhova.

79
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,520
Right? Yeah?

80
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,720
Excuse me.

81
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,640
I'll take him back now.

82
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,040
Oh, right.

83
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:33,160
Bye-bye, my Luca.

84
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,640
Good baby.

85
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:40,000
You're so good.

86
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:48,080
Come on, honey. Tul needs to rest.

87
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:50,400
Chris, you go ahead with Dad.

88
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:53,440
And make sure you handle things
at the community.

89
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,160
I need to talk to Tul.

90
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,720
Yes, Mom.

91
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,680
Get some rest too, okay?

92
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,840
Must feel pretty awkward, huh?

93
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,720
It's only a little over a year
after your marriage,

94
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:15,320
and now you're caught
between your mother and your wife.

95
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:18,640
Did Tul ever say anything?

96
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:24,400
She could put up with it at first.

97
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:28,080
Then Mom started interfering with her work,

98
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:31,600
making Tul work for the foundation
to support the church.

99
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:34,480
Tul wasn't okay with things
not being transparent there.

100
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:40,640
And then there's the whole mess with Rueang.

101
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:43,640
I know.

102
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:49,960
I'm the reason your mom
forced Tul to represent Rueang in court...

103
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,160
turning wrong into right

104
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:55,880
and black into white.

105
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:59,200
She was labeled a dirty lawyer.

106
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:02,120
Even her father's name got dragged into this.

107
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:07,200
That must be hard for her.

108
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:13,720
Now even choosing our baby's name
has become an issue, Dad.

109
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:18,960
Who knows?
We might end up fighting every day.

110
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:23,440
Mom and Tul wouldn't agree
on how to raise him.

111
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,280
Why did you go there?

112
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:35,720
Think of how devastated Chris would be
if something happened to you or the baby.

113
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,600
You're so reckless.

114
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,200
I went there to see Rueang.

115
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:47,000
You sound like you knew
something was going to happen there.

116
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:51,640
I didn't. How could I have known?

117
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,880
Why would you want to see him anyway?

118
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:57,120
You know he brought shame on Pornhova.

119
00:09:57,360 --> 00:10:00,760
Your father-in-law nearly lost his chance
to become the Church Council president.

120
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:11,400
I already got Rueang off just as you ordered.

121
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:13,920
But I...

122
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:17,320
was condemned for helping a bad guy.

123
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:21,760
They said I used Pornhova's money
and power for our own benefit.

124
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,120
Thank you so much, Tul...

125
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:34,880
for always obeying me.

126
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:54,360
You cleansed Pornhova of its stain,

127
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:59,280
helped my husband become the president
of the Church Council,

128
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,480
and you gave birth to Luca,

129
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:08,000
our new addition, who will grow up
to become president after his father.

130
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:13,280
Get some rest, okay?

131
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:14,960
I'll be going now.

132
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:22,080
Did you find Rueang?

133
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:26,600
He's dead.

134
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,960
It was a gas explosion.

135
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:31,880
The police said
the fire started at his house.

136
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,280
What about his wife and children?

137
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,760
Dead. All died in the fire.

138
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:43,520
You don't seem sad at all, Mother.

139
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:50,680
It was the Lord's will.

140
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:04,280
Where are you taking Tuang?

141
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:07,080
I'm taking him to sleep with me.

142
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:11,160
But ever since we got home,
you've kept him with you every night.

143
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,200
Please let me have some time with my baby.

144
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:14,920
Oh, dear.

145
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,440
Taking care of him all day is tiring enough.

146
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,840
Let him sleep with me, okay?

147
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,920
Think of it as me helping you out.

148
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:27,200
Say, "Goodnight, Daddy. Goodnight, Mommy."

149
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:28,240
Come on, sweetheart.

150
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:30,160
-Mom.
-But Mother...

151
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,240
Mother.

152
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:36,200
Keep your voice down. You'll wake Luca.

153
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:39,760
Please, let me have Tuang.

154
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,640
She's right, Mom.

155
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,520
Just let them sleep together.

156
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:46,960
Tuang?

157
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:48,960
Who's that?

158
00:12:49,040 --> 00:12:51,720
Hmm? There's no Tuang here, right?

159
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:59,800
Mom, please give Luca back to Tul.

160
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:01,440
I'm asking you.

161
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:06,320
No.

162
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,720
From now on...

163
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:17,960
Luca will sleep with me every night
until he can ask for his own room.

164
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:24,560
You're keeping a mother
away from her child, honey.

165
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:28,520
Keep her from him?
Come on. That's exaggerating.

166
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,800
I just want Luca to sleep with me

167
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:34,400
so I can read the Bible to him every night.

168
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:39,880
Let him absorb the Word of God
from an early age.

169
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:41,880
You're using religion

170
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:44,280
to overstep your boundaries
with my child, Mother.

171
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:48,680
No, I'm not.

172
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:52,320
I'm just preparing my grandson.

173
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:57,040
He'll grow up to be a doctor,
just as his name suggests,

174
00:13:58,120 --> 00:14:01,760
and become the third-generation
president of the Church Council after Chris

175
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,040
and Sansern.

176
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:08,000
Mom, you're getting ahead of yourself.

177
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:11,280
Tuang--I mean Luca
was only born a few days ago.

178
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,000
I'm not.

179
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,560
Everything is settled.

180
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:19,560
It's the Lord's will.

181
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:24,600
You can force Chris
to become the Church Council president

182
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:26,480
because he's your son.

183
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,800
But Tuang is my son.

184
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:33,280
I want him to have freedom with his life,

185
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:34,640
his career,

186
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:37,680
and his own choice of religion.

187
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:45,120
That's exactly why I can't
let you raise him alone.

188
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:50,120
I won't let the devil
raise Pornhova's bloodline.

189
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,760
And I won't let anyone
raise my son to become a devil.

190
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:14,040
-Mother? Mother!
-Mom...

191
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:24,880
I'm taking Tuang to England.

192
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:26,560
England?

193
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:30,920
It's the only way to keep your mom from him.

194
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:34,640
Even if she follows,
she probably won't stay long.

195
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:40,360
Well...

196
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:46,040
she sure knows Marisa better than anyone.

197
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:50,920
What do you think?

198
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,920
You should go, son.

199
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:09,040
The Word says, "If anyone is in Christ,

200
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:11,000
the new creation has come.

201
00:16:11,520 --> 00:16:14,040
The old has gone,

202
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:16,400
the new is here."

203
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:21,120
2 Corinthians 5:17.

204
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:25,520
For some, a new beginning is a blessing.

205
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:31,000
But for those who refuse to let go,
it is a discipline.

206
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,440
Tulya...

207
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:40,680
16 YEARS LATER

208
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:09,960
I'm so glad you've moved nearby, Mr. Wichai.

209
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:12,600
It's more convenient being in my area.

210
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:16,720
Listen, Mary. If your church ever needs help,

211
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:18,880
don't hesitate to tell me.

212
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:20,440
Thank you.

213
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:22,840
What about you, Tul?

214
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:25,400
I heard you've resumed your law practice.

215
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,960
Yes, I'm taking over my father's firm.

216
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,680
Your father...

217
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,080
Right, Judge Tuangtham.

218
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:32,600
I do miss him.

219
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:35,680
Did your son come back with you?

220
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:39,000
Oh, yes. They've moved back.

221
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:40,320
-Oh, really?
-Yes.

222
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,320
Luca is such a lovely boy.

223
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:44,480
He's very smart, just like his father.

224
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:48,560
Excuse me, Mrs. Marisa. It's time.

225
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:50,440
-Excuse me.
-Please, go ahead.

226
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:51,880
-This way, please.
-Excuse me.

227
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:53,600
Right this way.

228
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:58,840
A little closer together, please. Nice!

229
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:03,440
Have both of you decided
to move back here permanently?

230
00:19:03,520 --> 00:19:06,160
Yes, more or less.

231
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:10,080
After my father passed away last year,

232
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:12,320
Tul and I...

233
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:15,560
decided to come back
and look after my mother.

234
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:18,080
You're such a devoted son.

235
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:21,720
No wonder people are switching
to the Pornhova Church.

236
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:24,120
And besides being a minister,

237
00:19:24,200 --> 00:19:27,440
he also serves as an executive
at Pornhova Hospital,

238
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:30,160
under the Church Council's network.

239
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:35,120
Is that why many people expect Mr. Sattha

240
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:38,280
to be nominated
as the next Church Council president?

241
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:42,280
I believe he will certainly be nominated.

242
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:46,640
Even though he's only been back
for a little over a year?

243
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:49,000
That's actually an advantage.

244
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:52,600
It makes him transparent

245
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:55,880
and detached from old politics.

246
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,680
-Look this way, please.
-Can you put your arm around him?

247
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:01,800
Tul and Chris, come closer.

248
00:20:03,040 --> 00:20:04,720
-Over here, please.
-Sure.

249
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:06,240
-This camera, please.
-This way.

250
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,840
This one is interesting.

251
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:14,960
Mom...

252
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:18,600
Uncle Dee is more qualified
to be president than I am.

253
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:22,800
He's a minister, a pastor,

254
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:24,680
and Dad's younger brother.

255
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:27,280
But Sadudee
isn't in the direct line of descent.

256
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:28,800
That means

257
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:31,760
it must be you only.

258
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:37,160
But I don't know if I'm ready.

259
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:39,520
You are.

260
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:41,960
Which qualification do you lack?

261
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:47,160
Under Regulation 136...

262
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:50,840
first, you must be a pastor.

263
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:55,960
Second,

264
00:20:57,200 --> 00:21:01,240
you must be of sound mind
and free from drinking and gambling.

265
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:02,720
Third,

266
00:21:03,280 --> 00:21:05,120
you must not be homosexual.

267
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:07,320
Fourth,

268
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:09,800
you must have only one wife,

269
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:14,000
and she must be a full member
of the Church Council.

270
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:16,120
So, which do you lack?

271
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:18,760
None.

272
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:24,480
And nothing will disqualify my son
from those requirements.

273
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:28,920
Sign here, please.

274
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:38,480
Enjoy.

275
00:21:49,800 --> 00:21:50,720
What are you doing, honey?

276
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:53,720
I just showered. I'm about to go to bed.

277
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:57,760
-Okay. Goodnight, then.
-Night, Mom.

278
00:21:57,840 --> 00:21:58,480
Bye.

279
00:22:05,560 --> 00:22:06,880
Our son's back.

280
00:22:08,040 --> 00:22:11,080
Looks like the three of them
will be staying for a while.

281
00:22:18,480 --> 00:22:21,840
He said he was worried about me
since you weren't around.

282
00:22:36,160 --> 00:22:37,960
I want Chris to be like you.

283
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:39,240
I don't understand.

284
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:42,280
Why must you force me and Chris into this?

285
00:22:43,640 --> 00:22:47,600
No matter what we are, we can serve God.

286
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:51,200
But holding the highest position
in the Church

287
00:22:51,280 --> 00:22:53,360
allows us to serve Him even more.

288
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:56,360
Honey, where did you get this idea from?

289
00:22:57,840 --> 00:22:59,320
If that's what you believe,

290
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:01,160
why don't you become president?

291
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:03,360
Can I?

292
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:07,040
Has there ever been a female president
in the Church Council?

293
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:10,560
A woman wouldn't even get nominated.
Am I wrong?

294
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:12,680
If I could do it myself,

295
00:23:12,760 --> 00:23:15,480
I wouldn't waste my time
trying to convince you.

296
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:25,400
Let me ask you this. Why does this position

297
00:23:26,600 --> 00:23:28,800
matter so much to you?

298
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:34,520
EDEN GALLERY

299
00:23:36,840 --> 00:23:40,240
If there's a painting you like,
feel free to take a closer look.

300
00:23:40,320 --> 00:23:42,360
There are more upstairs too.

301
00:23:43,520 --> 00:23:44,640
I'll leave you to it.

302
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:46,840
Thank you. God bless.

303
00:24:34,440 --> 00:24:37,000
Excuse me, is this yours?

304
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:40,560
Yes. Thank you.

305
00:24:46,560 --> 00:24:47,560
Do you like this painting?

306
00:24:50,080 --> 00:24:50,840
Yes.

307
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:53,960
The family closet to the God’s hand.

308
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:59,200
I've heard about it for so long,
and now I'm actually looking at it.

309
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:01,440
It's beautiful.

310
00:25:04,040 --> 00:25:07,040
It's beautiful in an intriguing way.

311
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:13,400
Mrs. Marisa surely
didn't paint this just for its beauty.

312
00:25:14,320 --> 00:25:17,960
She probably wanted to remind people
how far they are from God,

313
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:23,000
and what they must do
to get as close to Him as possible.

314
00:25:26,120 --> 00:25:27,560
Are you an artist?

315
00:25:29,000 --> 00:25:31,280
You see right through my mother's intentions.

316
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:33,120
Oh.

317
00:25:34,520 --> 00:25:36,160
Is Mrs. Marisa your mother?

318
00:25:37,720 --> 00:25:38,760
Yes.

319
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:41,880
Speaking of this painting,

320
00:25:41,960 --> 00:25:46,560
she made it to remind Christians

321
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:48,400
to always remember Him.

322
00:25:48,840 --> 00:25:50,920
Wealthy collectors around the world

323
00:25:51,200 --> 00:25:52,640
keep trying to buy it,

324
00:25:53,320 --> 00:25:54,680
but my mother refuses

325
00:25:55,040 --> 00:25:56,640
because she loves it too much.

326
00:25:58,200 --> 00:26:01,400
I think it represents our family.

327
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:03,520
Pornhova...

328
00:26:04,440 --> 00:26:05,680
A blessing from God.

329
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:13,480
Anyway, I'll have to excuse myself.

330
00:26:14,040 --> 00:26:16,720
The auction is starting soon.

331
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:23,200
Here, take it.

332
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:38,600
I'll excuse myself.

333
00:26:39,680 --> 00:26:40,440
Okay.

334
00:27:01,240 --> 00:27:04,800
May the Lord grant you all a blessed evening.

335
00:27:08,800 --> 00:27:11,240
Hello, everyone.

336
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:14,080
Welcome to Eden Gallery

337
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:16,560
and to the auction of my paintings.

338
00:27:16,640 --> 00:27:18,640
I'm Marisa Pornhova.

339
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:23,680
Back in the 12th century,

340
00:27:23,760 --> 00:27:27,600
there was a female artist
named Hildegard of Bingen.

341
00:27:28,040 --> 00:27:29,200
She was a female preacher

342
00:27:29,280 --> 00:27:32,720
in an era when women
weren't even allowed to have a voice.

343
00:27:34,840 --> 00:27:38,920
A woman who weaponized faith
to negotiate with the power of men.

344
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:41,920
A woman who painted visions from God.

345
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,760
Hildegard of Bingen.

346
00:27:44,040 --> 00:27:45,640
She was chosen.

347
00:27:46,680 --> 00:27:48,000
So was I.

348
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:50,360
I wasn't born a Christian.

349
00:27:50,600 --> 00:27:55,000
But He allowed me
to see the light others could not see,

350
00:27:55,080 --> 00:27:57,640
to hear words not everyone could hear,

351
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:59,280
because He chose me.

352
00:27:59,360 --> 00:28:01,840
And I'm not an ordinary painter.

353
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:06,080
I paint the visions He places in my heart.

354
00:28:06,160 --> 00:28:07,920
Today's auction is no different.

355
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:10,280
Behold the Hand of God.

356
00:28:10,360 --> 00:28:13,320
Apple, the Forbidden Fruit.

357
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:15,600
The apple, the forbidden fruit.

358
00:28:50,760 --> 00:28:52,960
Pupee, go see what's happening.

359
00:28:53,200 --> 00:28:54,000
Yes, ma'am.

360
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:17,600
Hello?

361
00:29:17,920 --> 00:29:19,080
Grandma?

362
00:29:19,760 --> 00:29:20,680
Grandma...

363
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:23,240
What is it, honey? Take your time.

364
00:29:25,200 --> 00:29:26,240
Grandma...

365
00:29:28,120 --> 00:29:28,840
I...

366
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:30,640
I hit someone with the car.

367
00:29:35,880 --> 00:29:37,160
Are you hurt, Luca?

368
00:29:39,240 --> 00:29:40,160
I'm fine.

369
00:29:40,840 --> 00:29:42,440
What about the person you hit?

370
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,840
I don't think they're dead.

371
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:51,120
Where are you?

372
00:29:51,840 --> 00:29:55,280
I'm... a block away from the gallery.

373
00:29:55,960 --> 00:29:57,160
Why aren't you home?

374
00:29:57,600 --> 00:29:58,280
I...

375
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:03,240
It's okay. Stay put.
I'll send someone to handle it.

376
00:30:04,760 --> 00:30:05,640
Understand?

377
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:09,760
Song.

378
00:30:11,640 --> 00:30:14,800
Go check the nearby alley. Luca is there.

379
00:30:14,880 --> 00:30:16,320
Bring him here.

380
00:30:21,280 --> 00:30:22,560
Mr. Tuang, this way.

381
00:30:34,280 --> 00:30:35,440
I'd like to report an accident.

382
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:37,320
A car accident.

383
00:30:38,560 --> 00:30:39,640
You lied to me, Tuang.

384
00:30:39,960 --> 00:30:41,400
You said you were going to bed.

385
00:30:41,480 --> 00:30:43,840
Why didn't you tell me about this?

386
00:30:45,800 --> 00:30:48,760
I just wanted to surprise Grandma.

387
00:30:50,840 --> 00:30:51,920
Oh, Luca.

388
00:30:52,720 --> 00:30:56,360
It's so beautiful, honey. I love it.

389
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:58,840
Thank you so much.

390
00:30:58,920 --> 00:31:01,440
Mom, he just hit someone with a car.

391
00:31:02,880 --> 00:31:06,080
It's nothing. No one died.

392
00:31:06,520 --> 00:31:09,120
I've already asked Mr. Wichai to help.

393
00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:12,240
Our people will take the blame for Luca.

394
00:31:12,760 --> 00:31:13,880
No, we can't do that.

395
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:15,560
What if they press charges?

396
00:31:16,160 --> 00:31:18,080
I've had Song compensate them already.

397
00:31:18,720 --> 00:31:21,640
I'm sure it's enough
to make them forget Luca's face.

398
00:31:22,880 --> 00:31:24,600
Money talks, you see.

399
00:31:25,520 --> 00:31:28,560
But I want to take responsibility
for what I did.

400
00:31:28,840 --> 00:31:29,720
That's right.

401
00:31:29,800 --> 00:31:31,800
Your father and I
will take you to the police.

402
00:31:32,480 --> 00:31:33,520
Chris,

403
00:31:33,600 --> 00:31:35,600
if you take Tuang to the station,

404
00:31:35,680 --> 00:31:40,280
it will reinforce your image
as a transparent, honest, law-abiding leader

405
00:31:40,360 --> 00:31:42,040
who doesn't abuse his power.

406
00:31:42,120 --> 00:31:43,600
No, never.

407
00:31:44,040 --> 00:31:45,640
It'll ruin Luca's reputation.

408
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:47,600
It'll ruin Chris too,

409
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:50,720
right as he's running
for the Church Council president.

410
00:31:52,800 --> 00:31:55,200
You can't control what people think.

411
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:58,400
Can you risk an online backlash?

412
00:31:58,480 --> 00:31:59,640
Who will take responsibility?

413
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:00,880
Can you handle it?

414
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:03,440
Don't be so sure of yourself, Tul.

415
00:32:03,800 --> 00:32:06,840
Mom, there are CCTVs there.

416
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:08,920
That's the block we live on.

417
00:32:09,680 --> 00:32:11,280
Those cameras are ours.

418
00:32:11,840 --> 00:32:14,080
I've had Song take care of them.

419
00:32:14,160 --> 00:32:16,280
Let's just drop this, okay?

420
00:32:16,800 --> 00:32:19,640
I just followed the Lord's will.

421
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:23,480
It was your will, Mother,
to be above the law.

422
00:32:23,560 --> 00:32:24,360
That's enough.

423
00:32:25,280 --> 00:32:27,560
You will not blaspheme against His glory.

424
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:29,720
Your laws are just paper.

425
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:32,400
And so is your Bible.

426
00:32:39,760 --> 00:32:41,760
This conversation ends tonight

427
00:32:43,160 --> 00:32:44,520
if you still consider me your mother.

428
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:08,280
STEVEJOB123: TUANG, IT'S ME!

429
00:33:08,360 --> 00:33:09,440
STEVEJOB123: YOU JUST SHOT ME AGAIN

430
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:13,600
STEVEJOB123: HEY, I'M ON YOUR TEAM

431
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:16,640
STEVEJOB123: YOU KEEP BLOWING MY HEAD OFF

432
00:33:18,760 --> 00:33:25,560
TUANG CA: I MADE MY MOM
AND GRANDMA FIGHT AGAIN

433
00:33:25,640 --> 00:33:30,080
STEVEJOB123: THEY LOVE YOU A LOT,
SO STAY POSITIVE

434
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:38,880
TUANG CA: HAH, MORE LIKE LOVING THEMSELVES

435
00:33:46,360 --> 00:33:47,880
Your mother was being selfish.

436
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:52,840
She'll spoil Tuang rotten
if she keeps this up.

437
00:33:54,280 --> 00:33:56,000
So what are you going to do?

438
00:33:57,040 --> 00:33:58,000
Honestly?

439
00:33:58,840 --> 00:34:00,120
I want to take Tuang to England.

440
00:34:01,160 --> 00:34:05,240
Your mom and I have fought
almost every day since we got here,

441
00:34:05,320 --> 00:34:08,360
and Tuang's been so spoiled
that this happened.

442
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:13,000
My dad isn't here to help us this time, okay?

443
00:34:13,960 --> 00:34:16,480
I don't care whether your mom agrees.

444
00:34:16,560 --> 00:34:19,240
I only care whether you do.

445
00:34:21,000 --> 00:34:23,320
You're planning to leave
without telling my mom?

446
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:24,840
Yeah.

447
00:34:31,640 --> 00:34:33,400
I found a boarding school for Tuang.

448
00:34:37,080 --> 00:34:38,560
Let me take him there.

449
00:34:39,320 --> 00:34:40,880
Then I'll come back and help you.

450
00:34:41,400 --> 00:34:44,600
Think about it. If Tuang isn't here,

451
00:34:44,680 --> 00:34:47,760
your mother and I
probably won't fight as much,

452
00:34:48,680 --> 00:34:50,440
and you won't feel so awkward either.

453
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:55,360
Sounds good. But what if she finds out later?

454
00:34:56,160 --> 00:34:57,080
Chris...

455
00:34:58,480 --> 00:34:59,680
just think about our son.

456
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:03,480
We have to get him out of here first.

457
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:13,320
TUANGTHAM LAW OFFICE

458
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:15,840
You just got back.
Now you're off to England again?

459
00:35:16,280 --> 00:35:18,000
Watch out for your mother-in-law.

460
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:20,440
Your husband is so weak-willed.

461
00:35:21,000 --> 00:35:23,080
One push from his mom,
and he'll spill everything.

462
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:26,200
I just hope Chris stays strong this time.

463
00:35:27,120 --> 00:35:28,200
You're tough, you know?

464
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:31,920
You fight with his mom all the time,
yet you still stick with him.

465
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:35,280
Chris hasn't done anything wrong.

466
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:37,560
He's a good husband,

467
00:35:38,200 --> 00:35:39,160
a good father,

468
00:35:39,520 --> 00:35:40,680
and a good son.

469
00:35:43,280 --> 00:35:44,680
I feel bad for him.

470
00:35:45,240 --> 00:35:47,880
He's stuck between his mother and his wife.

471
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:52,040
Whichever one he chooses, he loses anyway.

472
00:35:58,160 --> 00:36:01,160
PORNHOVA CHURCH

473
00:36:27,600 --> 00:36:29,560
I baptize you, Nalin,

474
00:36:30,200 --> 00:36:33,960
in the name of the Father,
the Son, and the Holy Spirit.

475
00:36:34,600 --> 00:36:35,400
Amen.

476
00:36:35,960 --> 00:36:43,520
Amazing grace, how sweet the sound

477
00:36:44,240 --> 00:36:51,720
That saved a wretch like me

478
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:59,360
I once was lost, but now am found

479
00:37:00,080 --> 00:37:07,800
Was blind, but now I see

480
00:37:09,960 --> 00:37:17,120
'Twas grace that taught my heart to fear

481
00:37:17,640 --> 00:37:25,400
And grace my fears relieved

482
00:37:25,480 --> 00:37:29,320
How precious did

483
00:37:29,400 --> 00:37:31,080
That grace appear...

484
00:37:31,160 --> 00:37:32,160
Mary...

485
00:37:33,640 --> 00:37:36,280
look at how that woman is looking at Chris.

486
00:37:37,240 --> 00:37:38,920
It feels a little off.

487
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:40,120
Don't you think?

488
00:37:41,120 --> 00:37:42,920
It's like they know each other.

489
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:46,240
They don't.

490
00:37:46,320 --> 00:37:50,120
Thro' many dangers, toils, and snares...

491
00:37:59,960 --> 00:38:01,640
INCOMING CALL: MARISA

492
00:38:01,720 --> 00:38:05,120
I'm sorry. I really didn't mean to hit you.

493
00:38:06,040 --> 00:38:09,280
It's okay. Just a broken arm
and stitches in my head.

494
00:38:09,720 --> 00:38:12,320
I cut in front of your car anyway.

495
00:38:12,560 --> 00:38:14,560
You really didn't have to come.

496
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:15,880
We had to.

497
00:38:16,600 --> 00:38:18,720
Tuang must take responsibility

498
00:38:19,320 --> 00:38:20,560
and apologize.

499
00:38:22,360 --> 00:38:23,440
Don't worry.

500
00:38:23,880 --> 00:38:25,320
Mrs. Marisa already paid me.

501
00:38:26,600 --> 00:38:30,800
I promise I won't tell anyone
that the driver is you.

502
00:38:34,040 --> 00:38:36,880
INCOMING CALL: MARISA

503
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:39,320
Since you're fine, we'll be going now.

504
00:38:40,040 --> 00:38:41,400
Please get some rest.

505
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:42,840
Okay. Thank you.

506
00:38:44,200 --> 00:38:47,480
MISSED CALL: MARISA

507
00:38:49,640 --> 00:38:53,680
INCOMING CALL: MARISA

508
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:55,200
She probably wants to check on me.

509
00:38:55,280 --> 00:38:56,400
MISSED CALL: MARISA

510
00:38:58,440 --> 00:38:59,400
Mom,

511
00:38:59,920 --> 00:39:03,040
are you sure we're leaving
without telling Grandma?

512
00:39:04,720 --> 00:39:05,600
Why?

513
00:39:06,480 --> 00:39:07,440
You don't want to go?

514
00:39:07,840 --> 00:39:10,080
I do. I like it there better.

515
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:13,040
But how are we going to avoid Grandma?

516
00:39:13,440 --> 00:39:15,040
Won't Dad let it slip?

517
00:39:16,160 --> 00:39:17,560
Your dad promised,

518
00:39:17,640 --> 00:39:19,840
and he agreed to let you stay there.

519
00:39:20,320 --> 00:39:23,800
I couldn't take you
out of the country otherwise.

520
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:26,000
You need written consent from both of us.

521
00:39:26,680 --> 00:39:29,400
I know Dad wants me to go.

522
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:35,960
But what if Grandma
finds out somehow and pressures him?

523
00:39:36,520 --> 00:39:37,960
Can he really keep a secret?

524
00:39:39,240 --> 00:39:40,640
Dad's so afraid of Grandma.

525
00:39:42,280 --> 00:39:45,160
-Thank you so much.
-Thank you.

526
00:39:45,240 --> 00:39:46,480
Welcome.

527
00:39:46,560 --> 00:39:49,320
You can join Pornhova church's chat group
by scanning this QR code.

528
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:51,440
Thank you very much. Please come inside.

529
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:55,720
You can join our church's chat group
by scanning this QR code.

530
00:39:57,600 --> 00:40:00,000
NALIN JOINED PORNHOVA CHURCH GROUP

531
00:40:02,320 --> 00:40:04,440
Hello, Reverend Sattha.

532
00:40:07,960 --> 00:40:09,920
Oh, we met at...

533
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:10,800
The gallery.

534
00:40:13,560 --> 00:40:15,520
I'm so glad you remember me.

535
00:40:15,600 --> 00:40:18,400
I came to this church
because of you, Reverend.

536
00:40:19,160 --> 00:40:20,160
Really?

537
00:40:22,520 --> 00:40:25,160
Pornhova Church is honored to welcome you.

538
00:40:27,560 --> 00:40:28,600
Miss...?

539
00:40:30,040 --> 00:40:30,960
Nalin.

540
00:40:33,560 --> 00:40:34,720
Nice to meet you.

541
00:40:40,200 --> 00:40:43,080
Thank you so much
for helping me get to know God

542
00:40:43,160 --> 00:40:45,000
and experience His love.

543
00:40:46,840 --> 00:40:48,120
It was my pleasure.

544
00:40:48,600 --> 00:40:51,200
Thank you too for choosing Pornhova Church.

545
00:40:55,680 --> 00:40:56,440
Chris.

546
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:03,600
Welcome to the Pornhova Church family.

547
00:41:05,960 --> 00:41:08,240
Chris, go talk to Uncle Sadudee.

548
00:41:09,120 --> 00:41:10,000
Yes, Mom.

549
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:11,320
Excuse me.

550
00:41:19,800 --> 00:41:21,640
Thank You for this meal.

551
00:41:22,040 --> 00:41:25,440
Please bless this food
and our time of fellowship together

552
00:41:25,520 --> 00:41:27,680
in the name of Jesus Christ.

553
00:41:28,240 --> 00:41:30,040
-Amen.
-Amen.

554
00:41:37,600 --> 00:41:39,920
Why didn't you bring Luca to church today?

555
00:41:41,160 --> 00:41:43,360
I took Tuang somewhere more important.

556
00:41:44,440 --> 00:41:46,000
What could be more important?

557
00:41:47,680 --> 00:41:50,840
I took him to visit the man
he hit with his car.

558
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:52,240
What?

559
00:41:53,160 --> 00:41:54,920
You disobeyed my order?

560
00:41:55,960 --> 00:41:56,720
I did.

561
00:41:57,920 --> 00:42:01,240
And from now on,
I won't attend any church events.

562
00:42:01,640 --> 00:42:02,560
Here, honey.

563
00:42:03,680 --> 00:42:07,000
Are you insane?
Has the Devil gotten into you?

564
00:42:07,680 --> 00:42:10,040
Mom, can we not do this today?

565
00:42:10,120 --> 00:42:12,520
We're doing it right here and now.

566
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:17,800
Tulya, you belong to Pornhova.

567
00:42:18,600 --> 00:42:20,240
So you belong to the Lord.

568
00:42:20,800 --> 00:42:23,080
Anything concerning Him comes first.

569
00:42:23,480 --> 00:42:24,840
I don't worship God.

570
00:42:25,400 --> 00:42:28,440
I became a Christian to support Chris

571
00:42:28,520 --> 00:42:30,720
and keep this family happy.

572
00:42:31,080 --> 00:42:32,080
That's all.

573
00:42:33,200 --> 00:42:35,440
Who do you worship then, if not Him?

574
00:42:35,680 --> 00:42:36,680
Myself.

575
00:42:40,160 --> 00:42:42,040
You're very confident, aren't you?

576
00:42:42,640 --> 00:42:44,120
I didn't realize lotus flowers
bloomed under your feet

577
00:42:44,200 --> 00:42:45,120
when you were born.

578
00:42:45,200 --> 00:42:46,360
There weren't any.

579
00:42:46,920 --> 00:42:49,720
And there was no Star of Bethlehem
over my head either.

580
00:42:52,320 --> 00:42:53,560
I have no religion.

581
00:42:54,240 --> 00:42:56,000
I don't believe in what I can't see.

582
00:42:58,760 --> 00:42:59,640
Naree?

583
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:03,640
Take the food up to my room.

584
00:43:04,200 --> 00:43:07,160
I cannot share a table
with an immoral person.

585
00:43:07,760 --> 00:43:10,400
At least I've never broken the law.

586
00:43:19,840 --> 00:43:21,160
Do you know John Marshall?

587
00:43:23,320 --> 00:43:24,840
The father of American constitutional law.

588
00:43:26,280 --> 00:43:27,000
Hmm.

589
00:43:27,600 --> 00:43:29,560
He went to church every Sunday.

590
00:43:47,520 --> 00:43:48,200
Tuang.

591
00:43:48,960 --> 00:43:49,800
Hurry.

592
00:44:38,360 --> 00:44:39,200
London, please.

593
00:44:49,320 --> 00:44:50,280
All set.

594
00:44:55,080 --> 00:44:56,040
Just a moment, please.

595
00:44:59,600 --> 00:45:00,560
What's up, Chris?

596
00:45:00,920 --> 00:45:02,480
Is everything okay?

597
00:45:04,440 --> 00:45:05,360
Yeah.

598
00:45:06,040 --> 00:45:09,760
I know what'll happen to you
when your mom finds out tonight.

599
00:45:10,480 --> 00:45:11,520
Hang in there, okay?

600
00:45:11,840 --> 00:45:12,680
I'll come back soon.

601
00:45:13,560 --> 00:45:14,360
Yeah.

602
00:45:14,800 --> 00:45:16,800
Tuang, talk to Dad.

603
00:45:19,320 --> 00:45:20,520
Hi, Dad.

604
00:45:25,920 --> 00:45:26,680
Hold on, Tuang.

605
00:45:36,760 --> 00:45:37,640
Yeah, we're good.

606
00:45:38,080 --> 00:45:39,240
Love you, Dad.

607
00:45:40,040 --> 00:45:41,040
I love you too.

608
00:45:41,720 --> 00:45:43,120
Call me when you get there.

609
00:45:55,080 --> 00:45:55,960
Hello.

610
00:45:56,560 --> 00:46:01,160
Excuse me.
Are you Ms. Tulya and Mr. Tuangboon Pornhova?

611
00:46:03,600 --> 00:46:04,240
Yes.

612
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:07,320
Please follow us to the back room.

613
00:46:08,280 --> 00:46:09,120
This way, please.

614
00:46:11,520 --> 00:46:15,320
Wherever there is love

615
00:46:15,400 --> 00:46:19,000
Hell is hiding there

616
00:46:19,080 --> 00:46:21,200
A land of dreams...

617
00:46:21,280 --> 00:46:22,400
I'm sorry,

618
00:46:22,480 --> 00:46:24,680
but Mr. Tuangboon Pornhova

619
00:46:25,440 --> 00:46:29,640
is not permitted to leave the Kingdom.

620
00:46:29,720 --> 00:46:33,120
There's a travel restriction
flagged in the system.

621
00:46:38,200 --> 00:46:39,880
I told you. Dad told Grandma.

622
00:46:44,560 --> 00:46:45,800
It wasn't your dad.

623
00:46:46,680 --> 00:46:47,680
Then who?

624
00:46:48,520 --> 00:46:52,240
The more I think, the more we differ
The more I love, the farther you go

625
00:46:52,320 --> 00:46:55,520
The more it tears me apart

626
00:46:56,040 --> 00:47:00,000
If there's only one thing I could ask for

627
00:47:00,080 --> 00:47:03,760
I'd ask for it all to end

628
00:47:03,840 --> 00:47:10,640
I want to take my life
Far away from this hell

629
00:47:10,720 --> 00:47:12,120
Welcome home!

630
00:47:22,040 --> 00:47:24,640
If you didn't let it slip,
how could your mom know?

631
00:47:24,720 --> 00:47:26,560
It was necessary.
I don't want Luca to leave me.

632
00:47:26,640 --> 00:47:29,360
You're declaring war
on your mother-in-law, you know that?

633
00:47:29,440 --> 00:47:30,040
I have to.

634
00:47:30,120 --> 00:47:31,840
Do you really think you can beat me?

635
00:47:31,920 --> 00:47:33,600
I never intended to beat you.

636
00:47:33,680 --> 00:47:34,560
Marisa?

637
00:47:34,640 --> 00:47:36,000
I just did what was right.

638
00:47:36,080 --> 00:47:39,160
Check every flight to England,
on every airline.

639
00:47:39,240 --> 00:47:42,080
What should I do, Reverend Sattha?

640
00:47:43,000 --> 00:47:44,200
Call me Chris.

641
00:47:44,280 --> 00:47:46,520
You're truly
a pillar of strength for me, Chris.

642
00:47:58,480 --> 00:48:01,840
The more you hug me

643
00:48:01,920 --> 00:48:05,760
The more I feel trapped

644
00:48:05,840 --> 00:48:09,520
The more I think, the more we differ
The more I love, the farther you go

645
00:48:09,600 --> 00:48:13,080
The more it tears me apart

646
00:48:13,160 --> 00:48:17,360
If there's only one thing I could ask for

647
00:48:17,440 --> 00:48:21,080
I'd ask for it all to end

648
00:48:21,160 --> 00:48:27,920
I want to take my life
Far away from this hell

649
00:48:29,560 --> 00:48:34,560
Once and for all
